Z||000000||rmorgandotcom||10-09-2001||12:13 AM||||How many different transaxles are there for fieros?  Which one do I have?<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE> <BR><LI><I>86 4 cylinder 5 speed</I><BR><LI><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/rmorgandotcom/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/rmorgandotcom/</A><BR></UL>||||reg||5
Z||000001||JayUSA77||10-09-2001||12:34 AM||||you have a muncie. Fiero came with 3 different kinds of transaxles, one is the izuzu, muncie, and getrag.  Getrag was in all 87 and 88 GT and some 86 GTs(Last 10 Percent) As for izuzu and muncie i just know our 86GT has a muncie.  Hope that helps<BR>j<P>------------------<BR>86' Black Fiero GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||rmorgandotcom||10-09-2001||12:48 AM||||Would this trans work with a fiero 2.8 v6?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Rick 88||10-09-2001||01:00 AM||||Your trans will bolt up to a 2.8, 3800 V6, Camaro/Firebird 3.4 (you will need to swap the starter to the opposite side), Cadillac 4.9 or Northstar. A small block Chevy will need an adapter plate from V8 Archie.<P>Rick 88||||reg||1
Z||000004||rmorgandotcom||10-09-2001||04:29 PM||||Cool thanks.||||reg||10
Z||000005||BOILERMAKER||10-09-2001||04:32 PM||||HUH???????  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>If I am not mistaken, no 4bangers came with Muncie 5 speeds (known as the Getrags).  Unless you have changed trannies, the only 5 speeds that came with 4bangers were the Isuzu 5 speeds.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Raydar||10-09-2001||04:38 PM||||Boilermaker is correct. <BR>All 4 cylinder 5 speeds were Isuzus.<BR>All 6 cylinder 5 speeds were Muncie/Getrags. Commonly known as Getrags.<BR>All 4 speeds, regardless of motor, were Muncies.<P>Many people put V-6s in to replace 4 bangers, and retain the Isuzu. <BR>I understand the weak link is the shift forks. <BR>I also understand that you have to use the 4 cyl clutch and release bearing.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||rmorgandotcom||10-09-2001||11:22 PM||||Well, I think that changes things quite a bit.||||reg||1
