Z||000010||Fallman||10-10-2001||01:29 PM||||Okay so question???  Your saying if i put in a 3.8 your recommending that i put in a T80N is that what i understand here. of course i would want to drag it but i would also want fuel economy and i hate automatics. but you think that i T80N would hold up longer then a manual???||||reg||1
