Z||000017||KissMySSFiero||10-18-2001||02:25 PM||||I believe V8 archie has 2 cars he has for daily drivers.  both with a LM1 crate motor putting out roughly 270hp.  both of which run the isuzu 5spd.  Tina runs her 383sbc that ran her car 12.9 in the 1/4.  she is running an isuzu as well.  they can handle the power of a v6 no problem.<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <BR>88FORMULA<BR>       <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>        <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
